-- Part IV, Articles 16-23: the supplementary clauses BVVC01-BVVC07 and any other clause the
-- parties agree. Each clause says "all other provisions of the contract are unchanged", so
-- each is encoded as the change it makes to a Part III rule, and bvvcx-claim.l4 applies the
-- changes. Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of
